{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tralalero Tralala, Bombardino Crocodilo, Lirili Larila, Tung Tung Tung Sahur \u2013 do you recognize these unusual characters?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/IMG_20250510_220708_194.jpg?t=1750709093\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN BRAINROT</strong> is a new exciting sequel to the famous <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> game series. In this version, you will not only use your intelligence, but also seriously train your memory, trying to remember all the unique neural network animals of Italian origin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/IMG_20250510_220921_195.jpg?t=1750709093\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have a fascinating journey through the amazing world of virtual creatures, each of which has a special character and unique features. Can you accurately distinguish these characters and name each of them correctly? Let's check your knowledge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/IMG_20250510_221231_391.jpg?t=1750709093\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic test format in the best traditions of the <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> series;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 fascinating questions of varying degrees of difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique achievement system with Italian animals;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting final result: find out which Italian animal YOU are!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An opportunity to evaluate how much time you've wasted studying these amazing creatures (and whether it was worth it...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Does this challenge seem easy to you?</strong> Dive into the game and test how well you remember these magical creatures. Good luck on your adventure in the world of Italian animals!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724870?t=1750709093","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724870?t=1750709093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/d3c8610b09294bf789c40d7b233075c5365d8269/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750709093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/d3c8610b09294bf789c40d7b233075c5365d8269/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750709093","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3754120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tralalero Tralala, Bombardino Crocodilo, Lirili Larila, Tung Tung Tung Sahur \u2013 do you recognize these unusual characters?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/IMG_20250510_220708_194.jpg?t=1750709093\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MEMOLOGY: ITALIAN BRAINROT</strong> is a new exciting sequel to the famous <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> game series. In this version, you will not only use your intelligence, but also seriously train your memory, trying to remember all the unique neural network animals of Italian origin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/IMG_20250510_220921_195.jpg?t=1750709093\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have a fascinating journey through the amazing world of virtual creatures, each of which has a special character and unique features. Can you accurately distinguish these characters and name each of them correctly? Let's check your knowledge together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/extras/IMG_20250510_221231_391.jpg?t=1750709093\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic test format in the best traditions of the <strong>MEMOLOGY</strong> series;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 fascinating questions of varying degrees of difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique achievement system with Italian animals;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting final result: find out which Italian animal YOU are!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An opportunity to evaluate how much time you've wasted studying these amazing creatures (and whether it was worth it...)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Does this challenge seem easy to you?</strong> Dive into the game and test how well you remember these magical creatures. Good luck on your adventure in the world of Italian animals!</p>","developers":["hannibalnotdead","Gamesforfarm"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724870/e6ce9bad6b304a5e035944c472110be8604fd69a/header.jpg?t=1750709093","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148527,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148527/movie480.mp4?t=1748869082","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto